'''Pavitr Prabhakar''' ({{IPA|hi|pəˈʋɪt̪r pɾəˈbʱaːkər|lang}}; born 22 May 1991) is a [[Balisca|Baliscan]] politician and activist. He has served as the [[Secretariat of International Affairs and Cooperation (Balisca)|Secretary of International Development]] since 3 March 2025, and has been a confederal delegate representing the [[Tetuán-Zofío (commune district)|Tetuán-Zofío]] [[commune district]] since 2019. 

